Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.46,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2}書き足し足した日々を
Dialogue: 3,0:01:50.46,0:01:51.25,OP-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Slash Dash
