Dialogue: 3,0:21:22.88,0:21:28.22,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}我一个人也能活下去
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.88,0:21:28.22,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}私　一人でも生きていけるから
Dialogue: 2,0:21:22.88,0:21:28.22,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\alpha&H64&}我一个人也能活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:28.22,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\alpha&H64&}私　一人でも生きていけるから
Dialogue: 3,0:21:28.76,0:21:33.14,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,所以没有什么好怕的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.76,0:21:33.14,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,何も怖くはなかった
Dialogue: 2,0:21:28.76,0:21:33.14,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\alpha&H64&}所以没有什么好怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:33.14,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\alpha&H64&}何も怖くはなかった
Dialogue: 3,0:21:33.89,0:21:36.41,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\c&HFFFFFF&}很多事情想不明白
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.89,0:21:36.41,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\c&HFFFFFF&}どうしてもどうしても
Dialogue: 3,0:21:36.41,0:21:44.28,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&}就在脑海中不停地打转
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.41,0:21:44.28,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&}分からない事ばかりが頭を巡った
Dialogue: 3,0:21:45.15,0:21:50.83,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\t(2760,3760,\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&)}你肌肤的温暖胜过一切
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.15,0:21:50.83,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\t(2760,3760,\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&)}何より温かい貴方の肌を
Dialogue: 3,0:21:50.83,0:21:54.71,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}我只是害怕失去这份温暖
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.83,0:21:54.71,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}失うのがただ怖かった
Dialogue: 3,0:21:56.33,0:22:01.42,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}就像悲伤融为一体  只求你和我
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.33,0:22:01.42,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}悲しみが溶け合う様に　私と二人
Dialogue: 3,0:22:01.88,0:22:06.05,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}无论前往何方  也不要松开彼此
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.88,0:22:06.05,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}何処に行こうが　離さないでね
Dialogue: 3,0:22:07.59,0:22:13.18,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}互相抚慰彼此身上的累累伤痕
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.59,0:22:13.18,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}互いの傷の数だけ　慰め合おう
Dialogue: 3,0:22:13.18,0:22:14.18,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}直到生命燃尽  直到死亡降临
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.18,0:22:14.18,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}それは命燃やして　死に至るまで
